[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20409.67, "timestamp": "05:40:09", "text": "我們來不及了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20415.59, "timestamp": "05:40:15", "text": "總共23個人，對吧？艾莉，那邊29號"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20445.788, "timestamp": "05:40:45", "text": "我出價40美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20453.68, "timestamp": "05:40:53", "text": "。 那塊瓷磚品質很差。我別無選擇。去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20459.43, "timestamp": "05:40:59", "text": "是的。去。別無他法。如果我現在去，我還能趕上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20459.75, "timestamp": "05:40:59", "text": "是的。"}]